{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670930725599791403","title":"供应链计划专员-汽车","description":"1、计划编制协助： 协助计划员收集销售预测与生产需求，整理并参与编制周/月度生产计划与物料需求计划（MRP）；\n2、物料与库存跟踪： 跟踪关键零部件的到货进度与安全库存水位，识别潜在的缺料风险并及时发出预警；\n3、库存结构优化： 协助统计呆滞物料（Slow-moving）与库存周转率，参与库存盘点与库存优化分析；\n4、供应商交付对接： 协助对接零部件供应商，跟进订单确认与送货计划执行，反馈供应商交付绩效基础数据。","requirement":"1、应届毕业生，本科及以上学历，供应链管理、物流工程、工业工程、数学/统计学等相关专业优先。\n2、逻辑思维极强，熟练掌握 Excel 数据分析，对 MRP/ERP 原理有基础理论认知；\n3、具备严谨的数理逻辑与分析预测能力，对数字变化敏感；\n4、具备出色的风险预判与应变能力，面对突发缺料能冷静梳理应对方案；\n5、良好的跨部门沟通意愿，能与采购、生产、仓储等多方顺畅对接。","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786028031069,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178743792710893677","name":"供应链类","en_name":"Supply Chain","i18n_name":"供应链类"},"job_id":"7670930725592877375","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":